{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11104290","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11104290","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1110429001:1":{"text":"에휴, 마지막 시련이 곧 시작될 텐데, 마음도 불안 불안한 게 영 자신이 없어!","source_cn":"唉，最后的试炼马上就要开始了，我这个心，七上八下，真是没底！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x860EB9C9E055C2F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1110429002:1":{"text":"나, 나는 온몸의 근육이 다 아파. 체력 소모가 너무 심했는지 힘이 없어.","source_cn":"我、我觉得肌肉酸痛，消耗过度，有些无力。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC09ABD265F895121","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1110429003:1":{"text":"휴, 마시면 체력이 강해지는 신기한 물약이라도 어디 없나! 약간의 부작용 정도는 참을 수 있는데.","source_cn":"哎！要是能有什么神奇的药水，喝下去就能增强体力该多好！...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4866B31E510A67F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1110429004:1":{"text":"하지만 이곳에 처음 왔는데, 어디 가서 그런 물약을 구하겠어...","source_cn":"可是我们初来乍到，去哪里找这样的药水呢……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C0F623BED9ADB48","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1110429004":{"text":"하지만 이곳에 처음 왔는데, 어디 가서 그런 물약을 구하겠어...","source_cn":"可是我们初来乍到，去哪里找这样的药水呢……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C0F623BED9ADB48","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1110429005:1":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 아르사와 소렌의 연기가 형편없을 거라는 걸 알고 있긴 했는데...","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8B6DC7B5C773AD7B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 아르사와 소렌의 연기가 형편없을 거라는 걸 알고 있긴 했는데...","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 아르사와 소렌의 연기가 형편없을 거라는 걸 알고 있긴 했는데...","variant_male_record_index":"122659","variant_female_record_index":"122660","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1110429006:1":{"text":"정말 이 정도일 줄 몰랐네요! 치피라도 안 속겠어요!","source_cn":"竟然会差到这个地步！即使是满满，也不会上当的！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8BDD6276B5023983","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"정말 이 정도일 줄 몰랐네요! 치피라도 안 속겠어요!","female":"정말 이 정도일 줄 몰랐네요! 치피라도 안 속겠어요!","variant_male_record_index":"122661","variant_female_record_index":"122662","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1110429008:0":{"text":"아이구, 참가자인가? 마침 이 스모키가 우연히 들었는데... 체력을 강화하는 물약을 찾으신다고?","source_cn":"哎呀呀，两位是参赛者？阿熏碰巧听了一耳朵！莫非是在寻找...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x467D23D860F1186A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1110429009:0":{"text":"네, 맞아요! 이 근처에 트라이브가 있다고... 흠흠!","source_cn":"没错没错！听说这附近有个蛮血——唔唔！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC3CCC74F7687ED62","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1110429010:0":{"text":"크흠! 그 물약이 급하게 필요한데, 혹시 어디서 구할 수 있는지 아세요?","source_cn":"咳咳咳！我们急需那种药，你知道什么地方能搞到吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x476ED6B99CC1B91A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1110429011:0":{"text":"음, 그런 약은 나도 알고 있어. 효과가 아주 끝내주지! 마시면 힘이 솟아올라서 군신 브루투스도 두렵지 않을걸!","source_cn":"唔，那种药我也知道。效果可真是神了！喝下去力量暴涨，面...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA227182A7949F9CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1110429012:1":{"text":"... 효과가 그렇게나 좋아요?","source_cn":"……效果真的有这么好？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x928A20F0CF598D67","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1110429013:0":{"text":"솔깃하지? 당신처럼 젊은 용사일수록 이런 포션이 더 필요한 법이야! 두 사람 운이 참 좋네. 마침 우리가...","source_cn":"是不是很令人动心？像您这样的年轻勇士，更是需要这种药剂...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF0B73C3586C5F762","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1110429014:1":{"text":"그런 약을 좀 갖고 있어. 물론 조금 비싸긴 한데... 가성비도 좋고, 게다가 두 병 사면 할인도 되니 나쁘지 않지!","source_cn":"咱们手头就有一些。当然，贵是贵了点……不过绝对物超所值...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x46892B6E790286C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1110429015:1":{"text":"크크끽끽!","source_cn":"吱吱叽叽叽！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6C1D4B240715EEFB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1110429016:1":{"text":"많이 비싸나요? 그럼 안 되는데... 저희 부족은...","source_cn":"很贵吗？还是算了吧，我们的氏族……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2DC83FB01420380C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1110429017:1":{"text":"잠시만! 다른 집에 가면 이런 약 없다니까. 나 스모키만의 레시피라고!","source_cn":"留步，勇士！我保证别人家没有这样的药，这是我阿熏的独家配方！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x73E9DE42E600C73C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1110429018:1":{"text":"이 근처에서 약을 팔고 있는 건 당신뿐이라는 거네요?","source_cn":"你是说，这附近只有你在卖药？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x163132A5636CA689","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1110429019:1":{"text":"그럼! 내 이래 봬도 포션 제조 기술은 이 아센 사막에서 끝내준다니까!","source_cn":"没错！别看我这样，配药的手艺可是荒角沙漠独一份！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA608E1F995F5AD18","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1110429020:1":{"text":"역시 당신이 이 근처에서 활동하는 불법 약장수였군요. 가시죠? 칼라가 당신을 찾고 있어요.","source_cn":"果然你就是那个活动在附近的非法药贩。走吧，曼卡拉有事找你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x84B58623039B668E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1110429021:1":{"text":"스모키라고 했죠? 거기서요. 나랑 얘기 좀 해요!","source_cn":"阿熏是吧？站住，跟曼卡拉聊聊吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE56F9B2AE4E9EAC6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1110429022:1":{"text":"아아! 날 잡으러 온 거였어?! 그... 그럼 나는 이만!","source_cn":"啊啊！是来抓我的吗！我……先走一步！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB5C9A00FA2312A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:6:0:1":{"text":"... 꿀잼이네...","source_cn":"……太好笑了","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x765D139E20888525","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"... 꿀잼이네...","female":"... 꿀잼이네...","variant_male_record_index":"63694","variant_female_record_index":"63695","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1110429007:1":{"text":"이런... 칼라도 효과가 이렇게 처참할 줄 몰랐어요. 아무래도 좀 무리수였군요?!","source_cn":"这……曼卡拉也没想到效果这么惨烈！果然我是有点强人所难了吧？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD5F0025FDBAA47AF","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"이런... 칼라도 효과가 이렇게 처참할 줄 몰랐어요. 아무래도 좀 무리수였군요?!","female":"이런... 칼라도 효과가 이렇게 처참할 줄 몰랐어요. 아무래도 좀 무리수였군요?!","variant_male_record_index":"122663","variant_female_record_index":"122664","document_titl